  "baseCommit": "417d3d4b14d2c6d1a2493d4f3ace81f8522d1f71",
  "reason": "Add YM2608-only FM/SSG operation resolution and Worklet scheduling. Existing chips keep their immediate paths. The optional chip-port control receiver defaults to absent; shared FM state adoption only guards DAC access on non-DAC chips. No native core, WASM, mixer gain, audio rendering loop or historical measurement is replaced. Authenticated predecessors support exact default PCM tests.",
